#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automated Lead Generation:</b> Every submission on your \"Contact Us\" "
"page instantly creates a brand-new opportunity in your <b>CRM App</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pembuatan Prospek Otomatis:</b> Setiap kiriman pada halaman \"Hubungi "
"Kami\" Anda secara instan membuat peluang baru di dalam <b>Aplikasi CRM</b>."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralize Rewards:</b> Effortlessly build, monitor, and manage your "
"entire ecosystem of loyalty campaigns and promotional programs from one "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pusatkan Hadiah:</b> Bangun, pantau, dan kelola seluruh ekosistem "
"kampanye loyalitas dan program promosi Anda dengan mudah dari satu dashboard."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Crucial Review:</b> You must review all e-commerce settings to ensure "
"they align with your internal business policies (e.g., when invoices are "
"generated, whether a mandatory customer check-in is required for ordering, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tinjauan Penting:</b> Anda harus meninjau semua pengaturan e-commerce "
"untuk memastikan kesesuaiannya dengan kebijakan internal bisnis Anda "
"(misalnya, kapan faktur dibuat, apakah pemeriksaan pelanggan wajib "
"diperlukan untuk pemesanan, dll.)."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Delivery Methods:</b> Go to <b>Website &gt; Configuration &gt; Delivery "
"Methods</b> to define all available options and their costs."
msgstr ""
"<b>Metode Pengiriman:</b> Buka <b>Website &gt; Konfigurasi &gt; Metode "
"Pengiriman</b> untuk menentukan semua opsi yang tersedia dan biayanya."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Direct Redirection:</b> Embed high-converting call-to-action (CTA) "
"buttons that send readers straight to your event registration page."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pengalihan Langsung:</b> Sematkan tombol call-to-action (CTA) dengan "
"konversi tinggi yang langsung mengarahkan pembaca ke halaman pendaftaran "
"acara Anda."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>E-commerce Category:</b> For easier product retrieval by customers on "
"your online store."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kategori E-commerce:</b> Untuk memudahkan pengambilan produk oleh "
"pelanggan di toko online Anda."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>External Providers:</b> Check if a predefined Odoo connection exists if "
"you work with specific shipping carriers."
msgstr ""
"<b>Penyedia Eksternal:</b> Periksa apakah koneksi Odoo yang telah ditentukan "
"sebelumnya tersedia jika Anda bekerja sama dengan kurir pengiriman tertentu."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>From the CRM app:</b> Track client interactions in real time and use the "
"<b>Sales App</b> to quickly send tailored quotations for B2B leads or custom "
"customer requests."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dari aplikasi CRM:</b> Lacak interaksi klien secara real time dan gunakan "
"<b>Aplikasi Sales</b> untuk mengirim penawaran yang disesuaikan dengan cepat "
"bagi prospek B2B atau permintaan khusus pelanggan."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Generate Membership Barcodes:</b> Link a unique barcode to a customer’s "
"digital or physical membership card for seamless scanning at your Point of "
"Sale (POS)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Buat Barcode Keanggotaan:</b> Tautkan barcode unik ke kartu keanggotaan "
"digital atau fisik pelanggan untuk pemindaian yang lancar di Point of Sale "
"(POS) Anda."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>In-Store Pickup (Click &amp; Collect):</b> If you wish to offer this, you "
"must <b>activate the setting</b> within the <b>Website Settings</b> first."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pengambilan di Toko (Klik &amp; Ambil):</b> Jika Anda ingin menawarkan "
"ini, Anda harus <b>aktifkan pengaturan</b> di dalam <b>Pengaturan Website</"
"b> terlebih dahulu."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Key Product Settings:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Pengaturan Produk Utama:</b>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Layout Settings:</b> Adjust the visual presentation and layout of "
"products using the <b>website editor</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pengaturan Tata Letak:</b> Sesuaikan tampilan visual dan tata letak "
"produk menggunakan <b>editor website</b>."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Logistics &amp; Pricing:</b> Define ticket prices, event times, and "
"capacity limits."
msgstr ""
"<b>Logistik &amp; Harga:</b> Tentukan harga tiket, waktu acara, dan batas "
"kapasitas."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> Increased capability leads to higher complexity and more "
"maintenance."
msgstr ""
"<b>Catatan:</b> Peningkatan kapabilitas menyebabkan kompleksitas yang lebih "
"tinggi dan lebih banyak pemeliharaan."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Our Advice:</b> Stick with your current streamlined configuration until "
"you’re fully comfortable. When you're ready to upgrade, try the Inventory "
"module on a duplicated database first to ensure it fits your workflow. 😉"
msgstr ""
"<b>Saran Kami:</b> Tetap gunakan konfigurasi Anda yang sekarang sampai Anda "
"benar-benar nyaman. Saat Anda siap untuk meningkatkan, cobalah modul "
"Inventaris pada database yang diduplikasi terlebih dahulu untuk memastikan "
"modul tersebut sesuai dengan alur kerja Anda. 😉"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Payment Providers &amp; Methods:</b> Go to <b>Website &gt; Configuration "
"&gt; Payment Providers</b> and install <b>all</b> the payment methods and "
"payment providers you plan to offer (e.g., credit card processors, PayPal, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Penyedia Pembayaran &amp; Metode:</b> Buka <b>Website &gt; Konfigurasi "
"&gt; Penyedia Pembayaran</b> dan instal <b>semua</b> metode pembayaran dan "
"penyedia pembayaran yang ingin Anda tawarkan (contohnya, pemroses kartu "
"kredit, PayPal, dll.)."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Payroll:</b> Use this feature to handle <b>employee salaries and manage "
"holiday requests</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Payroll:</b> Gunakan fitur ini untuk menangani <b>gaji karyawan dan "
"mengelola permintaan cuti</b>."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Point of Sale Category:</b> For organizing transactions within your shop "
"system."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kategori Point of Sale:</b> Untuk mengatur transaksi dalam sistem toko "
"Anda."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Product Category:</b> For internal tracking and reporting."
msgstr "<b>Kategori Produk:</b> Untuk pelacakan dan pelaporan internal."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Product-Level Settings:</b> Define core product settings directly on the "
"<b>product form</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pengaturan Tingkat Produk:</b> Tentukan pengaturan inti produk langsung "
"pada <b>formulir produk</b>."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Publishing:</b> Each product can be <b>published independently</b> on "
"your online store."
msgstr ""
"<b>Penerbitan:</b> Setiap produk dapat <b>diterbitkan secara mandiri</b> di "
"toko online Anda."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Ready to scale your reach?</b> Explore the <b>SMS Marketing</b>, "
"<b>Social Marketing</b>, and <b>Marketing Automation</b> apps to build "
"advanced, multi-channel campaigns."
msgstr ""
"<b>Siap untuk meningkatkan jangkauan Anda?</b> Jelajahi aplikasi <b>SMS "
"Marketing</b>, <b>Social Marketing</b>, dan <b>Otomatisasi Marketing</b> "
"untuk membangun kampanye multi-saluran yang canggih."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Ready to take it a step further?</b> Explore the <b>Membership</b> and "
"<b>Pricelists</b> features to easily manage exclusive pricing for your "
"members."
msgstr ""
"<b>Siap untuk melangkah lebih jauh?</b> Jelajahi fitur <b>Keanggotaan</b> "
"dan <b>Daftar Harga</b> untuk mengelola harga eksklusif bagi anggota Anda "
"dengan mudah."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Registration &amp; Launch:</b> Choose how attendees sign up and publish "
"the event page directly to your website."
msgstr ""
"<b>Registrasi &amp; Peluncuran:</b> Pilih cara peserta mendaftar dan "
"terbitkan halaman acara langsung ke website Anda."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Targeted Outbound:</b> Launch promotional campaigns tailored to specific "
"mailing lists."
msgstr ""
"<b>Outbound Terarget:</b> Luncurkan kampanye promosi yang disesuaikan untuk "
"daftar email tertentu."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Track Promotion Eligibility:</b> Instantly see exactly which active "
"rewards and promotional programs a specific customer can access."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lacak Kelayakan Promosi:</b> Lihat secara instan hadiah dan program "
"promosi aktif apa saja yang dapat diakses oleh pelanggan tertentu."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Want to automate your purchasing?</b> &gt; Integrate the <b>Inventory "
"App</b> to unlock automated reordering. Keep in mind while expanding your "
"ecosystem provides much greater capability, it also introduces more advanced "
"configurations to manage."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ingin mengotomatiskan pembelian Anda?</b> &gt; Integrasikan <b>Aplikasi "
"Inventaris</b> untuk membuka pemesanan ulang otomatis. Perlu diingat bahwa "
"meskipun memperluas ekosistem Anda memberikan kemampuan yang jauh lebih "
"besar, hal ini juga memperkenalkan konfigurasi yang lebih canggih untuk "
"dikelola."

